text = "Press Ask button to ask question.Click question to choose

Difficulty:
1. Easy mode : Narrows question down and provides hint 
 when there is a minute left on the clock and provides
 less jobs to choose from.
2. Medium mode : Has more question to choose from and
 no hint given.
3. Hard mode : Has more question to choose from has 
more jobs to choose from and no hint given."

